  Main Cooling Coil 1 Water Outlet Node,   !- Coil_Water_Outlet_Node
  Mixed Air Node 1,                                             !- Coil_Air_Inlet_Node
  Main Cooling Coil 1 Outlet Node;               !- Coil_Air_Outlet_Node
</code></pre>

