  ,                                     !- Power per Zone Floor Area {W/m2}
  ,                                     !- Power per Person {W/Person}
  0,                                    !- Fraction Latent
  0.3,                                  !- Fraction Radiant
  0,                                    !- Fraction Lost
  0,                                    !- Carbon Dioxide Generation Rate {m3/s-W}
  Cooking;                              !- End-Use Subcategory
</code></pre> <p>Global Gas Equipment example:</p> <pre><code>ZoneList,OfficeZones,Left Fork, Middle Fork, Right Fork;

GasEquipment,
