</code></pre>

Real Units: kg <p>This numeric field specifies the amount of refrigerant present within the condensate piping (kg) specified by the system designer, under standard rating conditions.</p> <p>The following is an example input for a cascade condenser.</p> <pre><code>Refrigeration:Condenser:Cascade,
