      SalesFloor,              !- Distribution Piping Zone Name
      ,                        !- Sum UA Receiver/Separator Shell
      ,                        !- Receiver/Separator Zone Name
      ,                        !- Evaporator Refrigerant Inventory {kg}
      ;                        !- End-Use Subcategory
</code></pre> <p>The following is an example input for a liquid-overfeed-type ("FluidPhaseChange") refrigeration secondary system.</p> <pre><code>  Refrigeration:SecondarySystem,
      SecondaryLowLoop,        !- Name
