</code></pre>

Real Units: kg Default: 0.0 <p>The value of this optional field is the refrigerant inventory present in the refrigeration chiller during ordinary operation. The value is used to produce an estimate of the total refrigerant present in the refrigeration system. The value is entered in kg.</p> <p>The following is an example input for a refrigeration air chiller.</p> <pre><code>   Refrigeration:AirChiller,
